# Every text file checks out with LF, whatever the editor or git config. A
# `core.autocrlf=true` checkout would otherwise hold CRLF text, and whatever the
# build embeds or a test compares byte-for-byte breaks there only:
# blessed snapshots (#1036), the game `CLAUDE.md` template `include_str!` reads
# (#1345). Binary files are detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
